   "start": 1486.28,
   "end": 1487.68,
   "text": "Ask her how she is.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1490.1,
   "end": 1491.0,
   "text": "How are you?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1493.58,
   "end": 1494.86,
   "text": "Fine, thanks. And you?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1495.52,
   "end": 1497.28,
   "text": "Tell her that you're fine, too.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1500.26,
   "end": 1501.3,
   "text": "I'm fine, too.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1504.28,
   "end": 1505.8,
   "text": "I'm fine too, thanks.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1509.24,
   "end": 1512.18,
   "text": "Mr. Ramirez, you're from Mexico, aren't you?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1512.54,
   "end": 1513.0,
   "text": "Say.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1513.48,
   "end": 1516.48,
   "text": "Да, мы с женой живем в Гвадалахаре.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1522.02,
   "end": 1524.72,
   "text": "Yes, my wife and I live in Guadalajara.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1530.28,
   "end": 1532.18,
   "text": "Ask her if she's been to Mexico.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1535.52,
   "end": 1536.88,
   "text": "Have you been to Mexico?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1540.14,
   "end": 1543.52,
   "text": "Да, но, к сожалению,",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1547.68,
   "end": 1549.48,
   "text": "Yes, but unfortunately.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1552.92,
   "end": 1555.18,
   "text": "Я не была там.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1557.7,
   "end": 1559.1,
   "text": "I haven't been there.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1561.74,
   "end": 1563.64,
   "text": "Вот уже несколько лет.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1566.36,
   "end": 1567.58,
   "text": "for a few years.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1570.38,
   "end": 1572.02,
   "text": "Подходит официант.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1572.02,
   "end": 1576.02,
   "text": "Скажите ему «Бокал красного вина, пожалуйста».",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1579.1,
   "end": 1581.16,
   "text": "A glass of red wine, please.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1585.28,
   "end": 1586.74,
   "text": "And I'd like a beer.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1587.38,
   "end": 1590.02,
   "text": "Tell the waiter. Tell the waiter.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1590.24,
   "end": 1594.1,
   "text": "Одно пиво и бокал красного вина, пожалуйста.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1599.78,
   "end": 1602.68,
   "text": "A beer and a glass of red wine, please.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1608.24,
   "end": 1612.78,
   "text": "Позже, выходя из кафе, вы увидели коллегу по работе.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1613.02,
   "end": 1615.64,
   "text": "Скажите, там моя коллега?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1619.38,
   "end": 1620.94,
   "text": "There's a colleague of mine.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1624.6,
   "end": 1625.56,
   "text": "She asked,",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1625.7,
   "end": 1627.22,
   "text": "Ваша коллега?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1630.08,
   "end": 1631.54,
   "text": "A colleague of yours?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1634.48,
   "end": 1638.6,
   "text": "Да, ее зовут Сьюзен Дэвис.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1643.2,
   "end": 1645.46,
   "text": "Yes, her name is Susan Davis.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1649.76,
   "end": 1651.76,
   "text": "Она из Бостона.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1654.32,
   "end": 1655.94,
   "text": "She's from Boston.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1658.46,
   "end": 1659.96,
   "text": "From Boston.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1662.48,
   "end": 1664.94,
   "text": "Я не видела ее уже год.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1668.52,
   "end": 1670.58,
   "text": "I haven't seen her for a year.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1674.14,
   "end": 1676.32,
   "text": "I haven't seen her for a year.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1680.5,
   "end": 1688.38,
   "text": "Вы разговариваете с коллегой, но вам пора уходить. Скажите ей, что вы сожалеете, но вам нужно идти.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1692.84,
   "end": 1695.06,
   "text": "I'm sorry, but I have to leave now.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1699.38,
   "end": 1702.08,
   "text": "К сожалению, я должен ехать в центр.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1702.08,
   "end": 1702.28,
   "text": "Center.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1707.66,
   "end": 1709.82,
   "text": "Unfortunately, I have to go into town.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1714.92,
   "end": 1715.78,
   "text": "А потом?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1718.34,
   "end": 1719.12,
   "text": "And then?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1722.02,
   "end": 1724.3,
   "text": "Один мой друг собирается зайти ко мне.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1727.72,
   "end": 1729.92,
   "text": "A friend of mine is coming to visit.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1733.7,
   "end": 1734.56,
   "text": "She asks.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1735.22,
   "end": 1737.68,
   "text": "Почему бы нам вместе не поужинать?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1737.94,
   "end": 1739.08,
   "text": "Попробуйте это сказать.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1742.46,
   "end": 1744.32,
   "text": "Why don't we have dinner together?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1752.64,
   "end": 1755.98,
   "text": "Вы знаете ресторан на Парк Авеню?",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1760.18,
   "end": 1762.36,
   "text": "Do you know the Park Avenue restaurant?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1766.42,
   "end": 1769.0,
   "text": "Скажите кратко «нет».",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1771.1,
   "end": 1772.66,
   "text": "No, I don't.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1774.64,
   "end": 1778.08,
   "text": "Это хороший ресторан.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1780.88,
   "end": 1782.12,
   "text": "It's a good restaurant.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1784.94,
   "end": 1786.74,
   "text": "И не слишком дорогой.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1789.8,
   "end": 1791.34,
   "text": "And it's not too expensive.",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1795.02,
   "end": 1800.04,
   "text": "Хорошо, тогда сегодня вечером в 7 часов в ресторане на Парк Авеню.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1808.1,
   "end": 1812.48,
   "text": "All right. Then tonight at 7 o'clock at the Park Avenue restaurant?",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1820.58,
   "end": 1824.22,
   "text": "Хорошо, увидимся вечером.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1827.92,
   "end": 1829.3,
   "text": "Okay, see you tonight",
   "lang": "en"
  },
  {
   "start": 1832.5,
   "end": 1835.52,
   "text": "Это конец шестого урока.",
   "lang": "ru"
  },
  {
   "start": 1844.9,
   "end": 1846.34,
   "text": "Продолжение следует...",
   "lang": "ru"
  }
 ]
}